      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, main text",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Benim ru\u0304h\u0323um Mu\u02bfallim Salmu\u0304n,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Ba\u02bfde\u2019s-sela\u0304m bi\u2019l-\u02bfizz ve\u2019l-ikra\u0304m, inha\u0304\u02be ve i\u02bfla\u0304m olunan\u00a0budur ki:</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Benim ru\u0304h\u0323um, is\u0327bu h\u0323a\u0304mil-i varak\u0323a Mans\u0323u\u0304r ser bo\u0308lu\u0308k ol ca\u0304nibe reva\u0304ne olunmus\u0327tur.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Ve mezku\u0304run yedinde ba\u02bfz\u0307\u0131 teza\u0304kir vard\u0131r. Ve Ka\u02bfbe-i s\u0327eri\u0304fe teveccu\u0308h itmekdir</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>mura\u0304d\u0131. Vus\u0323u\u0304l bulduk\u0323da, lut\u0323f [u\u0308] mu\u0308ru\u0308vvet idu\u0308b, mu\u0308sa\u0304\u02bfade idesiz zi\u0304ra\u0304</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>k\u0323adi\u0304mi\u0304 beledi\u0304nizdir, ve size i\u02bftima\u0304d idu\u0308b, ol ca\u0304nibe tevec- cu\u0308h eylemis\u0327dir.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Kerem idu\u0308b, mezbu\u0304r\u0131 \u02bfavk\u0323 itdirmeyu\u0308b, himmetiniz diri\u0304g\u0307 itmeyesiz</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>zi\u0304ra\u0304 i\u02bftima\u0304d\u0131 size ke-veli\u0304dir [?], ba\u0304g\u0307-\u0131 k\u0323adi\u0304min la\u0304z\u0131md\u0131r ki ma\u02bflu\u0304m olmaya.</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "transcribing"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
